<title>UK: GOLF-WORLD MATCHPLAY FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WORLD MATCHPLAY FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>WENTWORTH, England 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of 36-hole</p>
<p>first round matches in the World Matchplay championship on the</p>
<p>6,957-yard West Course at Wentworth on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Steve Stricker (U.S.) beat 8-Steve Elkington (Australia) 3 and</p>
<p>2.</p>
<p>Stricker plays 1-Ernie Els (South Africa) in Friday's second</p>
<p>round.</p>
<p>5-Colin Montgomerie (Britain) beat Ian Woosnam (Britain) 3 and</p>
<p>2</p>
<p>Montgomerie plays 4-Mark Brooks (U.S.) in second round</p>
<p>7-Mark O'Meara (U.S.) beat Nobuo Serizawa (Japan) 7 and 5</p>
<p>O'Meara plays 2-Tom Lehman (U.S.) in second round.</p>
<p>Vijay Singh (Fiji) beat 6-Phil Mickelson (U.S.) by one hole</p>
<p>Singh plays 3-Steve Jones (U.S.) in second round</p>
</text>
